  • `tests/integration/Spe.Integration.Tests/Phase2RecordMatchingTests.cs`: both record-match routes.
  • `tests/integration/Sprk.Bff.Api.IntegrationTests/PlaybookByIdEndpointTests.cs` (cold/warm cache, 404, cross-tenant) and `PlaybookByNameDeprecationTests.cs` + `PlaybookByNameDeprecationTestFixture.cs`: by-id and by-name; their hosts will now need the playbook decision's seams.
  • Unit and contract homes: `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/Filters/AiAuthorizationFilterTests.cs`, `.../Filters/PlaybookAuthorizationFilterTests.cs`, `.../Api/Ai/NodeEndpointsTests.cs`, `.../Api/Ai/PlaybookRunEndpointsTests.cs`, `.../Services/Ai/PromptLibrary/PromptLibraryServiceTests.cs`, `.../Services/RecordMatching/RecordMatchServiceTests.cs`, `.../Services/Ai/PlaybookOrchestrationServiceTests.cs`, `tests/integration/contract/Api/Ai/DispatchSessionEndpointContractTests.cs` and `tests/integration/contract/Api/Ai/RecordSearchRowAuthorizationContractTests.cs` (both compiled into Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests via `Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests.csproj:77`), `tests/integration/auth/Ai/SessionOwnershipTests.cs`, `tests/integration/auth/UnifiedAccessControl/OperationAccessPolicyCompletenessTests.cs`, `tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/SessionOwnershipGuardTests.cs`.</background>
